[{"title":"天童道上二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"嶪岌崭岩太白峰，高名千古独称雄。\n放怀拟向山头立，宇宙都归一望中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60260,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬日","author":"袁燮","text":"茅檐穷腊负朝暾，不羡红炉兽炭温。\n始信太阳和气别，拟将此味献金门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60261,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"阳刚初复一何微，万汇亨嘉肇此时。\n只此胚胎须护惜，要教宇宙总熙熙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60262,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"朝来云物效嘉祥，和气初萌日渐长。\n相庆纷纷缘底事，由来人道贵阳刚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60263,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉簪","author":"袁燮","text":"琉璃为叶玉为葩，妙质天然不汝瑕。\n精彩照人香绝俗，遗簪端的自仙家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60264,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用前韵二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"无味之中味最长，东湖居士独先尝。\n乃知此药真良药，何必求他肘后方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60265,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用前韵二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"乞取刀圭救病身，韩公于此枉天真。\n何如夜坐忘躯壳，但有纤毫俱是尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60266,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百步尖","author":"袁燮","text":"一山屹立万山朝，壮观棱棱倚碧霄。\n惆怅故交埋玉处，高名千古共岧峣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60267,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观鱼","author":"袁燮","text":"波清日暖足优游，去去来来总自由。\n只为贪心除未得，竟随香饵上金钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60268,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其六","author":"袁燮","text":"荤膻屏去忽三年，筋力扶持老尚坚。\n所养固知先大体，人生何苦嗜肥鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60269,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其五","author":"袁燮","text":"朱门终日饫甘肥，绮绣盘筵鲙缕飞。\n宁识山林枯槁士，清风千古首阳薇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60270,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其四","author":"袁燮","text":"良朋过我食无鱼，茅屋相寻只茹蔬。\n莫道藜羹滋味薄，要知瓜祭必齐如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60271,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其三","author":"袁燮","text":"深林十月饱清霜，寒气侵凌味转长。\n世上甘腴有如此，拟排闾阖献君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60272,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"白菘肥脆真佳品，紫芥蒙茸亦可人。\n环舍满畦多且旨，寒儒专享未为贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60273,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"园蔬六首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"携锄抱瓮不辞劳，要使霜根足土膏。\n我去艰难生理窄，却疑学圃属吾曹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60274,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拒霜花","author":"袁燮","text":"谁将名字强称扬，弱质区区敢傲霜。\n霜陨叶枯红粉落，元来枨也未为刚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60275,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"袁燮","text":"浅深红穗绕汀洲，笑舞西风体力柔。\n雅意陂塘非玩物，令人却忆蓼花游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60276,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东林湛堂禅师喜雪韵五首 其五","author":"袁燮","text":"寂寞东林一老禅，殷勤念我惠佳篇。\n敢烦见在慈悲佛，为我投诚过去仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60277,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东林湛堂禅师喜雪韵五首 其四","author":"袁燮","text":"皇皇有若救头然，为计无聊只吁天。\n歼厥遗蝗须尺瑞，由来积玉兆丰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60278,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东林湛堂禅师喜雪韵五首 其三","author":"袁燮","text":"恨无佳政布民间，赋敛犹繁狱未宽。\n来岁若非禾稼熟，穷檐何以免饥寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60279,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东林湛堂禅师喜雪韵五首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"祈祷精诚觊上通，嘉祥未与去年同。\n老怀日夜忧无奈，安得寒花屡舞风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60280,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和东林湛堂禅师喜雪韵五首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"去岁寒云久积阴，四郊雪片腊中深。\n今年一稔民安业，老守区区慰此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60281,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和姜子谦游晁景迂祠","author":"袁燮","text":"百年风节仰英游，喜见新诗为点头。\n微诋大贤虽可恨，不妨千载略同流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60282,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和圆通禅老韵二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"新诗的皪缀明玑，道行清通照碧溪。\n尘绊无因到兰若，聊将两绝当留题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60283,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和圆通禅老韵二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"浮世营营只自私，谁参落叶与枯枝。\n西来面壁原无语，却费圆通几首诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60284,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏竹","author":"袁燮","text":"此君林下静无尘，苗裔生来便逸群。\n头角崭然圆玉峙，养成直节要凌云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60285,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏凌霄花","author":"袁燮","text":"松柏扳援有女萝，红英亦复蔓高柯。\n侵寻纵上云霄去，究竟依凭未足多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60286,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"织妇","author":"袁燮","text":"列屋閒居曳绮罗，霜刀裁剪竞新磨。\n那知红女经营苦，轧轧寒机几万梭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60287,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其七","author":"袁燮","text":"乍从尘土俯澄泓，瑩彻心神眼倍明。\n天下渊泉有如此，流清端的自源清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60288,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其六","author":"袁燮","text":"阴云解駮晴光好，藜杖逍遥足自怡。\n月色渐迟风力细，初春便是浴沂时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60289,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其五","author":"袁燮","text":"几处汪汪成巨浸，传闻昔日尽良田。\n兴除利害宁无策，忍把膏腴久弃捐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60290,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其四","author":"袁燮","text":"清香忽向暗中来，应为梅花取次开。\n爱汝风标真绝俗，何当环绕百千回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60291,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其三","author":"袁燮","text":"雨声初断暮云横，天意欲晴犹未晴。\n好向长空施巨手，扫除氛翳见清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60292,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"舟中无事阅陈编，千古高风挹圣贤。\n奔走徒劳竟何补，兴怀旧隐思凄然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60293,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郊外即事七首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"春风簸雨湿郊原，春水沄沄复旧痕。\n寂寞道傍堪叹处，柴门茅屋数家村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60294,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中度东湖","author":"袁燮","text":"宿霭埋山未肯收，晚风吹雨湿衣裘。\n渔舠一叶烟波里，添我胸中万斛愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60295,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"览镜二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"工夫一日不专精，面目尘埃已可憎。\n何必鉴人明得失，青铜相对即良朋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60296,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"览镜二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"朝来览镜一何衰，发秃容枯半白髭。\