"}},{"title":"紫薇花二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"蒙茸曲径紫薇花，几载藤萝巧蔽遮。\n暂借斧斤还旧观，依前万蕊吐新葩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢王恭父惠石岩花二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"生平悃愊了无华，投老胡为也爱花。\n家酿朋壶助清兴，会看落笔吐天葩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢王恭父惠石岩花二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"岩畔移来漫一丛，鲜鲜忽发十分红。\n细看颇与鬷明类，言善方知美在中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新月二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"至精那得久沈沦，造化回环自有神。\n满意只须三五夜，十分全体见天真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新月二首 其一","author":"袁燮","text":"昨夜璇霄素魄沦，一痕初复便精神。\n辉光万里从兹始，今夕端倪即是真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60326,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜡梅","author":"袁燮","text":"金相玉质旧同科，暗里清香万斛多。\n绝俗风流宁不似，调羹功用竟如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60327,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠卜道人二首 其二","author":"袁燮","text":"道人怪我年如许，宿债胡为未